                  "text": "Law 22:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kuwa mtu awaye yote aliye na kilema hatakaribia; mtu kipofu, au kiwete, au mtu aliye na pua iliyoharibika, au aliye na kitu kilichozidi vimpasavyo mwili, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
